			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add DisableUIFixes environment variable to build config\n\nIntroduce the `DisableUIFixes` environment variable in `astro.config.ts` to allow selective disabling of UI-specific fixes during the build process. This variable is passed to the runtime via `import.meta.env`, mirroring the existing `Disable` flag logic.\n\nThis addition provides granular control over the application's fix layer, enabling developers to isolate and test UI behaviors without permanent code removal, aligning with the project's modular build pipeline.",
